{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098600/extras/937961bb0d436e447f5a6e9157e8d046.avif?t=1770076471\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as a <strong>failed adventurer banished to the edge of the kingdom</strong> to manage a long-since-closed-down branch of the guild. With the help of the maid <strong>Anna</strong>, <strong>renovate the old run-down building</strong>, <strong>meet the native frog people</strong>, <strong>recruit new cute members</strong>, <strong>fall in love with them</strong>, <strong>save the forest</strong>, and, just maybe, <strong>restore your honour in the process</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098600/extras/1202eb1e5907289808f60c325710200d.avif?t=1770076471\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Idle Harem Dungeon</strong> is an idle incremental game about managing a group of adventurers as they fight through never-ending waves of monsters. <strong>Rebuild the run-down building</strong>, <strong>trade with frog people</strong>,<strong> sharpen the skills of the girls</strong>,<strong> deepen their bonds with you</strong>, and<strong> discover the secrets of the forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098600/extras/956a9cdcf64589e98302c17c604f2099.avif?t=1770076471\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Four unique and love